  "title": "Rent the Runway to Report Fourth Quarter and Fiscal Year 2025 Results on April 14, 2026",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, March 24, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Rent the Runway, Inc. (“Rent the Runway”) (Nasdaq: RENT) announced today that it expects to release its fourth quarter and fiscal year 2025 financial results for the quarter and year ended January 31, 2026 on Tuesday, April 14, 2026, before market open.",
